<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 3Com target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 3Com target raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Punk, Ziegel &amp; Knoell reiterated its aggressive buy rating on 3Com Corp and raised its target price on the shares to $100 from $80.</p>
<p>-- Punk, Ziegel raised its fiscal 1997 earnings estimate for 3Com to $2.37 per share from $2.22, and estimated 1998 earnings at $3.20 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 6-1/2 to 63-1/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
